OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of
OL,6,Frain will continue through this
OL,7,Fevening and overnight with some brief
OL,8,Fdrier interludes further south. Winds
OL,9,Feasing and a milder night than recent
OL,10,Fnights remaining largely frost free.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FCloudy with further spells
OL,13,Fof rain on Wednesday, heavy at times
OL,14,Fover the hills. Some drier and
OL,15,Fpossibly brighter interludes in the
OL,16,Fsouth. Feeling chilly in the north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
